{"title":"The Gossamer Muster","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Gossamer knights are gathering in the Walnut Deep. Captain Maren Holt wants to know who gives them their orders.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/captain-maren-holt\">Captain Maren Holt</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"captain-maren-holt\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/court-seal\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/84a3dd5b374c7994b477.svg\" alt=\"\">Court Seal</a> <b>×3</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/captain-maren-holt\">Captain Maren Holt</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors around 1699, 1798)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1699|1798|Captain Maren Holt\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Gossamer knights <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Court seals <span class=\"muted\">(3)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/court-seal\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/84a3dd5b374c7994b477.svg\" alt=\"\">Court Seal</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 1696, 1797</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1696|1797|Court seals\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>21,280</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>665,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Captain Maren Holt says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Captain Maren Holt:</b> Orders. Muster at the court and wait for the word. That&#39;s an army forming.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Captain Maren Holt:</b> I mean to stop it before it marches. Your pay. Stay close to town.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"I mean to stop it before it marches. Your pay. Stay close to town.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Gossamer Muster</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-gossamer-muster\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-gossamer-muster\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-gossamer-muster\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-gossamer-muster\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-gossamer-muster\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Captain Maren Holt says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-gossamer-muster\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}